## Project Overview

We are building Headly, a smart and user-friendly migraine-tracking mobile app.

The app allows users to:

* Log headache episodes on a calendar view, adding details such as: duration, intensity, location, specific triggers, medications taken, associated symptoms, etc.
* See statistics and trends for headache episodes (e.g., increasing in frequency compared to previous months, most common triggers, etc.)
* Export a PDF report like a "migraine journal" for the user's own benefit or to send to one's doctor
* For users who are on regular, preventative medications, implement a "medication reminder" system

Keep the implementation simple and readable.

